= iv
{parent=5c}
{scope}

= Solution
{parent=iv}

$y\prime(0)=0$ forces the odd series to vanish. The even recurrence terminates at degree $2N$ precisely when $\alpha=4N+1$.

See also: <Hermite polynomial>.

