= v
{parent=5c}
{scope}

= Solution
{parent=v}

After division by $e^{-x^2/2}$, $f\prime\prime-2xf\prime+8f=2$. The initial data and evenness give $f=1-3x^2+x^4$, hence $y=e^{-x^2/2}(1-3x^2+x^4)$.

See also: <Hermite differential equation>.

Solved by gpt-5.6-sol high.

