For $1\lt |z|\lt 2$ this becomes
$$\frac1{2z^2}-\frac3{4z}+\sum_{n\ge0}(-1)^nz^{-n-1}-\frac18\sum_{n\ge0}(-z/2)^n.$$

See also: <Laurent series>.

